Scope Guards:

- V1 is MCP plugins only.
- Do not add WorkOS, hosted Harbor user auth, hosted workspace requirements, or Harbor cloud dependencies.
- Do not add Orbit, workflows, apps, jobs, chat/agents, or Cloudflare runtime in this effort.
- Do not add STDIO MCP support in v1; support HTTP/streamable HTTP MCP URLs only.
- Do not require embeddings or external AI/model keys; use lexical/BM25 search only.
- Do not require write confirmations in v1; write-capable MCP tools can be invoked directly.
- Do not expose OAuth access tokens, refresh tokens, or encrypted secret values in UI or logs.
- Do not make runtime depend on `../harbor`; only use it as a source for the checked-in catalog seed/reference.
- Do not commit generated `.harbor` state, OAuth credentials, tokens, or local secrets.
- Keep SDK-owned MCP lifecycle logic in SDK packages; keep `apps/harbor-local` as a thin local product app over those APIs.

